<title>FINLAND: EFORE SIX-MONTH PROFIT FALLS 24 PERCENT.</title>
<headline>EFORE SIX-MONTH PROFIT FALLS 24 PERCENT.</headline>
<dateline>HELSINKI 1997-06-16</dateline>
<text>
<p>Six months to end-April, 1997</p>
<p>					   (million markka unless stated)</p>
<p> Profit before extraordinary items	    2.8 vs 3.7</p>
<p> Earnings per share (markka)		   0.17 vs 1.24</p>
<p> Net sales					  115.1 vs 88.7</p>
<p> Operating profit				   3.1 vs 3.5</p>
<p> Operating profit before depreciation	 7.3 vs 6.9</p>
<p> Depreciation					 2.3 vs 1.8</p>
<p> Net financial items		     charge 0.3 vs 0.2 gain</p>
<p> Extraordinary items			gain 24.6 vs nil</p>
<p> Profit before appropriations, taxes	 27.4 vs 3.7</p>
<p> Taxes						  7.4 vs 1.6</p>
<p> Net profit					  20.0 vs 1.8</p>
<p> Equity to assets ratio (percent)	    54.3 vs 54.4 end-Oct</p>
<p>NOTE - Full name of Finnish electronic components</p>
<p>manufacturer is Efore Oy (former Finlandia Interface Oy).</p>
<p>-- Helsinki newsroom +358 0 680 50 245, news@reuters.fi</p>
</text>
